+ * from the count beam_allocate and beam_free publish.
+ * Noted at the same two seats as the latency, so a
+ * class's calls, cycles, and steps share one
+ * denominator: door calls, allocation and free
+ * together, as the cycle ledger has always counted
+ * them. The termination table states allocation steps
+ * per class and the free's commit walk apart (at most
+ * 2,104 steps; 12 in the trace, atomic-sim/REPORT.md);
+ * the classes with trace traffic free small blocks,
+ * so for them the worst here is the allocation worst
+ * in every case the trace exercises. */
+static u64 iscandar_total_steps[ISCANDAR_CL_COUNT];
+static u64 iscandar_worst_steps[ISCANDAR_CL_COUNT];
